{
  "iri": "https://strandz.it/jigdaw/plugins/melgen/",
  "label": "MelGen",
  "comment": "Transport synced phrase-aware melody generator. Period, contour and answer shape a seeded line that plays in time with the session, follows an incoming line when asked, and answers Conductor CCs.",
  "vendor": "danja",
  "developer": "http://danny.ayers.name",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "registeredName": "melgen",
  "roles": [
    "trn:MidiGenerator"
  ],
  "accepts": [
    "trn:Midi",
    "trn:ControlMidi"
  ],
  "produces": [
    "trn:Midi",
    "trn:MelodyMidi"
  ],
  "cautions": [
    "Silent until the host transport is rolling and reports a tempo and a beat position. A generator with no idea what time it is would be guessing, and this one says so by producing nothing.",
    "Pure MIDI, no audio: route its MIDI output to an instrument. New, Notes and Rhythm are triggers that fire on the rising edge, so each press is one action.",
    "Monophonic by design. A new note ends the note before it rather than overlapping."
  ],
  "format": "trn:WebAudio",
  "licenceId": "Apache-2.0",
  "abi": "jig:Abi2",
  "requires": [
    "jig:MidiEvents",
    "jig:MidiOut",
    "trn:HostTransport"
  ],
  "prefers": [],
  "shape": {
    "audioInputs": 0,
    "audioOutputs": 0,
    "renderQuantum": 128,
    "latencyFrames": 0
  },
  "resources": {
    "module": "melgen.wasm",
    "processor": "melgen-processor.js"
  },
  "ports": [
    {
      "symbol": "root_note",
      "name": "Root Note",
      "default": 60,
      "minimum": 0,
      "maximum": 127,
      "paramIndex": 0
    },
    {
      "symbol": "scale",
      "name": "Scale",
      "default": 0,
